msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! Oh, I'm so glad you picked up... I could really use your help "
"right about now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Why, what's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"It's the loan sharks I was telling you about... They're at my parents' "
"house, tearing up the place as we speak..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "What? Are you there right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I'm in front of the house, yeah. It's behind Kariyushi Arcade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Okay, I'll be right there. And stay safe."
msgstr ""

